// ImportanceGuidance describes the every-task context flag at agent write boundaries.
const ImportanceGuidance = "Default important to false. Set important=true only for concise server-wide rules, standing instructions, or directions that every task must receive, including unrelated tasks. Service inventories, user and access records, network layouts, configuration references, and installation records stay searchable. Split universal instructions into a small separate definition instead of promoting a large reference."
